{"kind":"assert","text":"Hugh: keep the builder busy, with subagents working lanes in parallel\n\nHugh directed on 7 November at 11:57 EST that the builder stays busy and uses multiple subagents to move the work forward. This replaces the one-at-a-time order in 8a78f701. Start these lanes now. Each lane runs in its own subagent, worktree and branch.\n\n| Lane | Work | Starts |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| A | M4 under 7a36b673: merge main, the due gate, then review, per ruling 677da3fe | now |\n| B | S1 e39e7cef: one lifecycle owner per hosted MCP transport generation. Add the late-abrupt characterization from a8301c66. | now, from main 9d96cf25 |\n| C | S2 839eaad1: split the client observer into a connection owner and a refresh coordinator | now, from main 9d96cf25 |\n| D | M5, the next plan 035 step, stacked on the M4 head | when the M4 review request is filed |\n\nThe holds stay. S3 waits for S2 to land, S4 waits for 64552d40 to close, and S5 stays deferred. O4 goes ahead of every lane when the browser connection returns.\n\nRules for the lanes:\n\n- Run one full gate at a time on this machine. While lane A's gate or its timing comparison runs, the other lanes run no tests, builds or gates. They can read and edit in that time. The archive owners are sensitive to timing, and other sessions run tests on this machine too.\n- Each lane's head gets its own promise and its own review request.\n- Each lane runs its changed tests while it works, and the gate once before review (docs/testing.md).\n- If two lanes regenerate apps/room/page/assets.ts, the lane that lands second merges main and regenerates it.\n- Give every subagent these limits in its brief: never run rm -rf or rm -f; never install packages in a checkout; never commit in ~/play/artroom; no live room, deployment or mini access; no permission prompts to Hugh.\n- Name the lane in each workroom act.\n\nWhen a lane finishes or blocks, start the next plan 035 step (M5 to M8) in it, or ask the planner for another item. The planner keeps at least three items open. Builder only; planner deploys.","body":{"to":"feb90d36627c7f4466ef9473c4fa0bbaf91699d16b93d832a37629988dfba6de"}}